	"_comment": "Shared scene-animation parity fixture. Loaded VERBATIM by the Rust export test so preview (scenes/eval.ts) and export (render graph) evaluate identical video-layer transforms. `window` is the segment's [start,end]; evaluation is in that same time domain. Easing is [x1,y1,x2,y2]; all cases use LINEAR so expected values are implementation-independent (they exercise the window/phase/channel math, not the bezier solver). translateX/Y are canvas-normalized fractions; scale multiplies the video rect about centre.",
